<title>PHILIPPINES: First Holdings Q1 96/97 net 380.8 mln peso.</title>
<headline>First Holdings Q1 96/97 net 380.8 mln peso.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to September 30.</p>
<p>	    (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover			  413.004 vs 214.212</p>
<p>    Net income			380.851 vs 194.513</p>
<p>Note - Company's full name is First Philippine Holdings Corp. It has stakes in an electricity distribution firm and a power generation firm.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841-8937</p>
</text>
